filsys (1.2.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * mkfs v1: round the volume up to a multiple of 16 blocks so the free map
    exactly describes the image.
  * test_matrix: mkfs-cleanliness coverage at several volume sizes per format.

 -- David Walther <david@clearbrookdistillery.com>  Fri, 04 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

filsys (1.2.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * fsck: count unreferenced-but-unfree ("missing") blocks as errors.
  * mkfs: reject an oversized V1 volume and a PDP-7 size argument up front.
  * Normalise `-v` edition spellings; credit Keith Bostic and Paul Collinson.

 -- David Walther <david@clearbrookdistillery.com>  Fri, 04 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

